  "prefLabel": "Ins 2301.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-08-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide for the regulation and licensing of third party administrators and to set forth rules and procedural requirements which the commissioner deems necessary to carry out the provisions of RSA 402-H.\n\nSource. #5787, eff 2-14-94; ss by #7023, eff 7-1-99; ss by #7318, eff 8-1-00, EXPIRED: 8-1-08\n\nNew. #9510, eff 7-10-09; ss by #12228, eff 7-10-17",
